\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {A.1}{\ignorespaces Autonomous agent safety architecture: (1)~tool-schema boundary, (2)~human confirmation gate, (3)~EIP-7702 session key scope, (4)~prompt injection scanning and lifecycle middleware.}}{184}{figure.caption.262}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {A.2}{\ignorespaces Autonomous AI banking agent request path: browser UI $\to $ Vite dev proxy $\to $ CWB Express API (SSE) $\to $ MCP tool server (17 banking tools) $\to $ Qwen3-8B inference $\to $ human confirmation gate $\to $ write-tool execution $\to $ on-chain transaction.}}{185}{figure.caption.263}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {A.3}{\ignorespaces Expanded autonomous AI agent data flow with component boundaries: the browser UI streams from the CWB Express API; read-tool requests return immediately; write-tool requests pass through the human confirmation gate and are signed with the EIP-7702 session key before on-chain execution.}}{186}{figure.caption.264}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {A.4}{\ignorespaces EIP-7702 session key scope: approved tool list, 500~USDC per-transaction cap, 24-hour TTL, and revocation.}}{187}{figure.caption.265}%
